Z||000005||FieroSTETZ||04-12-2001||11:23 AM||||oh, it wouldn't be competetive against prepped machines, its just a way ballzy daily driver, since my fiero's been down for months - we lifted it and take it mudding, going offroad and such, and i was probably far more experienced at driving than anyone else entered. its part of a program to stop kids from streetracing - they also do drag races, and in the future, maybe GT style road racing||||reg||1
